 \"What sport is Vestri associated with?\", \"slot_hint\": \"sport\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 162, \"text\": \"Vestri (football club) Knattspyrnudeild Vestra, also known as Vestri, is the football department of the Vestri sport club and is based in Ísafjarðarbær, Iceland..\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d00\", \"start\": 163, \"end\": 200, \"text\": \"As of 2018 the men's team plays in 2.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d00\", \"start\": 201, \"end\": 213, \"text\": \"deild karla.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d00\", \"start\": 214, \"end\": 299, \"text\": \"The club was founded in 1986 under the name \\\"Boltafélag Ísafjarðar\\\", or BÍ for short.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d00\", \"start\": 300, \"end\": 369, \"text\": \"It first participate in the Icelandic tier-4 league, then known as 4.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d00\", \"start\": 370, \"end\": 477, \"text\": \"deild karla, that same year and their first coach was former Icelandic international player Björn Helgason.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d00\", \"start\": 478, \"end\": 630, \"text\": \"In 1988, Ísafjörður biggest club, Íþróttabandalag Ísafjarðar (ÍBÍ), folded after years of financial difficulties and most of their players moved over to\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 31, \"text\": \"//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d01\", \"start\": 32, \"end\": 449, \"text\": \"title=Vestri_ ( men % 27s_basketball ) & oldid=1281820173 `` Categories : Basketball clubs in Iceland Association basketball clubs established in 1986 1986 establishments in Iceland Íþróttafélagið Vestri Vestri ( basketball club ) Hidden categories : CS1 Icelandic-language sources ( is ) Articles with short description Short description matches Wikidata This page was last edited on 22 March 2025, at 18:17 ( UTC ).\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d01\", \"start\": 450, \"end\": 559, \"text\": \"Text is available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 License ; additional terms may apply.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d01\", \"start\": 560, \"end\": 629, \"text\": \"By using this site, you agree to the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d01\", \"start\": 630, \"end\": 640, \"text\": \"Wikipedia®\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 47, \"text\": \"of goals scored, number of cards and much more.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d02\", \"start\": 48, \"end\": 110, \"text\": \"IF Vestri top scorers list is updated live during every match.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d02\", \"start\": 111, \"end\": 303, \"text\": \"You can click on players from the roster above and see available personal information such as nationality, date of birth, height, preferred foot, position, player value, transfer history, etc.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d02\", \"start\": 304, \"end\": 385, \"text\": \"For today’s basketball schedule and results visit our basketball live score page.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0054-4ef5a503cc18:d02\", \"start\": 386, \"end\": 553, \"text\": \"About Basketball live scores on Sofascore livescore has live coverage from mo